WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Twenty-three runtime tests passed.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.599
But the task still failed.

3
00:00:03.599 --> 00:00:07.998
The requested check was the full N P M test
command.

4
00:00:08.798 --> 00:00:10.966
That command failed at lint.

5
00:00:10.966 --> 00:00:13.568
Runtime tests and type checks passed.

6
00:00:13.568 --> 00:00:15.737
These are three different results.

7
00:00:16.537 --> 00:00:20.589
In Brain Scanner, we saved those results
against separate criteria.

8
00:00:20.589 --> 00:00:25.046
The failure stayed visible in the report and
downloaded continuation brief.

9
00:00:25.846 --> 00:00:30.504
This is an illustrated owner demonstration,
checked with Codex and Chrome.

10
00:00:30.504 --> 00:00:32.621
Brain Scanner records supplied evidence.

11
00:00:32.621 --> 00:00:36.009
It does not independently prove that tests
ran.

12
00:00:36.809 --> 00:00:39.984
Try the free beta at brain scanner dot dev.

13
00:00:39.984 --> 00:00:42.806
Verify your email, then connect your coding
agent.

14
00:00:42.806 --> 00:00:45.628
The example and limitations are in the
description.

